        "description": "<p>How we collect, use and protect your personal data, and how you stay in control of it.</p>",
        "company_info": "<p>KARMICA BV, trading as KARMICARE · Vizierstraat 28, 8000 Bruges, Belgium · VAT BE 0676.972.896 · RPR Ghent, division Bruges</p>",
        "company_last_updated": "<p><a href=\"mailto:care@karmicare.com\" title=\"mailto:care@karmicare.com\">care@karmicare.com</a> · Last updated October 2026</p>",
